EN:
Fossils are so cool, aren't they?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}They make one ruminate on the
brevity of life. {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
¿A que los fósiles son tremendos?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Le hacen ver a uno que la vida es
tan breve que hay que vivirla a tope.

IT:
I fossili sono stranissimi, eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Chissà se anche i miei muscoli
diventeranno così, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}...

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Fossilien sind schon cool, oder?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0022:}}Aber sie auszugraben, grenzt echt
an Leistungssport, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
Fosiller çok havalı, değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}İnsanı hayatın ne kadar kısa olduğu
üzerine düşündürüyorlar. {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
